  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Union of the Mediterranean</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Initiatives under priority ares &quot;Social and Civil Affairs&quot;. The overall objective of this programme is to strengthen women&apos;s position in society through contributing to increased employability of youth and women, in North Africa (Morocco, Tunisia and Algeria). This will be done by closing the gap between labor demand and supply, and fostering a culture of entrepreneurship and private sector development.</narrative>
  </description>
